{"id":"n28147-1-4","stage":1,"title":"카레 · 咖喱","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28147-1-4-1","ko":"이 닭고기는 색이 좀 노랗네?","zh":"这鸡肉的颜色有点黄啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"닭고기는","meaning":"鸡肉","explanation":"닭고기：鸡肉；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"닭고기","audio":"/audio/3fa11269843277a5cc00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62268","senseId":"1","lemma":"닭고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닭고기는","audio":"/audio/73606d764a23a0919460.mp3"}},{"text":"색이","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색이","audio":"/audio/248f74bf792c52bb9759.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"노랗네?","meaning":"黄色的","explanation":"노랗다：黄色的；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"노랗다","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40101","senseId":"1","lemma":"노랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노랗네","audio":"/audio/9a38558bfd9775bb63f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3fa11269843277a5","term":"닭고기","zh":"鸡肉","audio":"/audio/3fa