:"구운","meaning":"烤，烧烤","explanation":"굽다：烤，烧烤；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"굽다","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60102","senseId":"1","lemma":"굽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구운","audio":"/audio/2cd8c322906b81a4796c.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"304c5e2238b9a3bb","term":"카레","zh":"咖喱，咖喱粉","audio":"/audio/304c5e2238b9a3bbfcd4.mp3","entryId":"28147","definition":"一种用姜黄、生姜、胡椒、大蒜等混合制成的黄色调味品。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"42864a47196d1d84","term":"가루","zh":"粉末，面儿","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3","entryId":"65209","definition":"坚硬的物体被粉碎或磨得很小。","pronunciation":["가루"]},{"id":"3b42ecf8717cc7fd","term":"바르다","zh":"抹，搽","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3","entryId":"62652","definition":"把液体或粉末等置于物体表面揉擦，使其被均匀涂抹。","pronunciation":["바르다"]},{"id":"f7b2a704ff9bb3f2","term":"굽다","zh":"烤，烧烤","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3","entryId":"60102","definition":"在火上把食物烧熟。","pronunciation":["굽ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/55500a9abe31c03be390.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28147","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequ